/Title (Once a scenario is simulated, Campus Twin turns the results into an actionable decision. Multiple possible solutions can be compared based on factors such as resource utilization, cost, capacity, energy consumption, scheduling conflicts, and operational constraints. Instead of simply showing numbers, the system highlights the trade-offs between alternatives and identifies which option produces the most favorable overall outcome. Genie can then explain why a particular option is recommended, allowing administrators to move from a natural-language question to an evidence-based decision backed by the campus data and simulations.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 327 0 R
>>
