504 0 obj
<<
/Title (Databricks Genie becomes the natural-language intelligence layer through which administrators interact with the digital twin. Instead of manually searching through spreadsheets, dashboards, or databases, users can simply ask questions such as "Which laboratories are underutilized?", "Why is this building consuming more energy?", or "Which classrooms are available tomorrow?". Genie interprets the question, accesses the relevant campus datasets in Databricks, performs the required analysis, and returns a clear, data-backed answer with relevant metrics and visualizations. This makes complex campus data accessible to users without requiring them to understand SQL or the underlying data structure.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 464 0 R
>>
endobj
