514 0 obj
<<
/Title (Campus Twin begins by creating a unified data foundation for the entire campus. Data from classrooms, laboratories, buildings, student enrollment, timetables, transportation, events, energy consumption, and resource usage is collected from different sources and standardized into a common structure using Databricks. Delta Lake provides the central, reliable storage layer, while data pipelines continuously process new and updated information. This creates a single source of truth that represents the current operational state of the campus and provides the historical data required for analysis and prediction.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 503 0 R
>>
endobj
